            <div xml:id="m-ce29fb45-01df-40a9-8f5a-cdf169832e85">
              <lg xml:id="m-26f0f7b1-195a-4df8-a0af-d249f90f0c27">
                <l xml:id="m-51e4d92c-770d-453d-9bb5-e237b5148b97" facs="#m-e5e3686b-5c23-46af-ae12-71030c2c3d82" label="ambiguous">n9z</l><l xml:id="m-f06c10c1-424c-4771-b847-75b2be789a32" facs="#m-c4d816cd-2af6-4be3-8246-436e0d8d7f51" label="text-like">Common of Doctors. Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-9dc9cc4f-2122-447e-8a69-a5c6274bed17" facs="#m-e624f947-629a-45c4-a26f-7c8669b1553b" label="ambiguous">um.</l><l xml:id="m-bfbcd972-fdfe-41c6-a34e-2557a7737fdd" facs="#m-21a0bbd2-1cd1-4947-8cb7-e13087575476" label="lyrics-like">After Septuagesima, the Allelúia. and its Verse are omitted: the Tract</l><l xml:id="m-3f9e0c9e-2c39-4c7c-b94b-31e3cf97ba69" facs="#m-ef57cfdc-4e8d-4697-a954-4e4d0d6c2919" label="lyrics-like">Beátus vir. p. 1184, is said instead.</l><l xml:id="m-d5e85fef-86f1-4d97-b159-2763b274bfbb" facs="#m-05a3c3d6-496d-45a9-8947-04abcd185b20" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time, the Gradual is omitted. The Alleluia, alleltia. Y. Amá¬</l><l xml:id="m-77fbeda8-4c8d-48eb-b793-dd3526600792" facs="#m-2b989c1c-a577-4ede-8f9d-1302926ea457" label="text-like">vit. p. 1191, is sung instead, and then the following.</l><l xml:id="m-f20bd686-de2d-4d68-8420-1a19d2c9a17b" facs="#m-c216575b-fb0e-4c3f-a26f-0b1aaeb609d9" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-877fa4de-cb70-41bc-8515-14fae578607c" facs="#m-3c207875-ad72-44cc-94f1-8e825ae8a1e4" label="lyrics-like">A Lle-lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-7b666a5b-5ce4-41c9-bc2c-6cfa873e6f89" facs="#m-c2dac22b-014b-44d3-aea2-1aaa735fa199" label="ambiguous">ia.</l><l xml:id="m-ee736216-2577-47f8-8e65-641456119354" facs="#m-843634d4-1c20-445d-b1ca-7b3bc904a90c" label="lyrics-like">V. Jú¬</l><l xml:id="m-b1e55fc6-c14c-4fb9-a0ce-a6cee253472c" facs="#m-20d0fd74-dc93-4b4f-a594-54aee5d33139" label="lyrics-like">stus ger-miná¬</l><l xml:id="m-8f691c3f-9ca9-42dd-ac2a-1427ac70c018" facs="#m-fcfea0ac-4ece-4b03-a17b-595962cde207" label="ambiguous">bit sicut li-li¬</l><l xml:id="m-1f3854fb-4836-41cb-8bc5-295df9bed37f" facs="#m-ad414e85-49c4-46f6-8df3-41d86502d569" label="lyrics-like">um: et flo-ré¬</l><l xml:id="m-00a4b878-64c1-44d6-85e2-befd7403cb59" facs="#m-e9395568-ee26-4bed-a640-c4611adf61e1" label="ambiguous">bit in</l><l xml:id="m-80daf954-37d3-42fb-9964-2106eae89f11" facs="#m-9b2654a7-edde-4360-ab75-eddbe0176726" label="lyrics-like">ae-tér- num“ ante</l><l xml:id="m-a7412aca-c662-4eb8-8e3d-d8dae4cbc677" facs="#m-237c3cc8-036d-43f2-8bbf-9cb0d9c3a087" label="lyrics-like">Dómi- num.</l><l xml:id="m-c62654cd-095e-4898-b5b9-417f5e185af4" facs="#m-bac0a906-9e6b-47f1-8eff-e8d79cc6bf43" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. S.b.</l><l xml:id="m-947c047c-6d16-4948-a0f4-00915378496d" facs="#m-b19d485b-a739-4173-9ef9-a124668664eb" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus discí-] caelis est. Nolite putáre, quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-2ab7cfef-59ef-4817-bd93-ad3103516878" facs="#m-36c916c6-0dce-430c-aa67-9d74c9aa4618" label="ambiguous">L pulis suis: Vos estis sal terrae.</l><l xml:id="m-6b47a22c-aba6-4bbc-aacd-a0035ecbe746" facs="#m-630ab979-ffbb-4b85-920d-64842ce9a152" label="lyrics-like">veni sólvere legem, aut prophétas:</l><l xml:id="m-589ea50d-ff5a-4ec6-8acd-e134f12e60b5" facs="#m-5d84ba8b-a2e3-4985-be63-58bf4a465a07" label="lyrics-like">non veni sólvere, sed adimplére.</l><l xml:id="m-8d0a7368-e262-4288-9ae9-40af9ca49294" facs="#m-bf859a75-203d-4d31-8c15-d7318b4bcbf2" label="lyrics-like">Quod si sal evanúerit, in quo salié¬</l><l xml:id="m-ac3148bc-b439-420e-a85e-2b158db62010" facs="#m-0b5a0703-cbf9-4c7e-ae76-f2d4d306f4b1" label="ambiguous">tur? Ad nihilum valet ultra, nisi ut</l><l xml:id="m-3557a36e-9719-49ef-825a-46db26ea240a" facs="#m-56c639a1-b659-4646-940a-6b2a910bd90d" label="ambiguous">Amen quippe dico vobis, donec</l><l xml:id="m-bac960f1-e505-4dc8-8837-cdac4cd98532" facs="#m-8a350cac-32af-42b9-ab5b-fc237ace2379" label="lyrics-like">mittátur foras, et conculcétur ab</l><l xml:id="m-af032568-596a-49c9-ad45-377362ac5722" facs="#m-323cb527-728e-4400-b393-4ee1949429cf" label="lyrics-like">tránseat caelum et terra, ióta unum,</l><l xml:id="m-da99fca6-b791-4082-801f-e1c55aba619f" facs="#m-3aa30198-b2b0-40da-b030-30ab35f815b1" label="ambiguous">aut unus apex non praeteribit a</l><l xml:id="m-a30d1080-2610-45ae-9795-b977c2912a0e" facs="#m-11a59ae9-48f3-4080-85fb-faf449b645cb" label="lyrics-like">homínibus. Vos estis lux mundi.</l><l xml:id="m-0ed076da-e006-4b45-a78f-5ff412532872" facs="#m-e408c6dd-80ca-4d4e-97d8-270fdb8b6474" label="lyrics-like">Non potest civitas abscóndi supra</l><l xml:id="m-5f441b02-7dd6-4712-b98f-68f4a80e2321" facs="#m-b62415d0-9f39-4f4d-b0d4-e318929c7d25" label="lyrics-like">lege donec ómnia fiant. Qui ergo</l><l xml:id="m-14c05a80-5610-4400-a6f4-6e1fe0a51bc6" facs="#m-a4ba2d20-4aed-484c-9da2-52eb000440ae" label="lyrics-like">montem pósita. Neque accéndunt</l><l xml:id="m-2211399e-0c16-4654-b4cd-dc338f91182f" facs="#m-9ae8a3c9-3c73-4b4d-9d06-a045e5baeef8" label="lyrics-like">sólverit unum de mandátis istis mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-12430a45-c502-428a-a5ed-ede22d0c8c0e" facs="#m-ec23f274-2b91-4296-b2fd-6edd8469e267" label="lyrics-like">nimis, et docúerit sic hómines, mí¬</l><l xml:id="m-8820ecc4-c047-444c-8c48-4a48d05f09f6" facs="#m-fa35f0af-bca1-47f3-a08c-7961cbaada7e" label="lyrics-like">lucérnam, et ponunt eam sub mó¬</l><l xml:id="m-c8bfac2c-d4f8-45fd-9060-e5d21b7e444b" facs="#m-908f1a7a-ea1c-4a6e-a302-de37006ef60a" label="lyrics-like">dio, sed super candelábrum, ut lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-a051738d-b767-4491-bc3f-e679507651bc" facs="#m-d683f144-7c78-47a4-80f9-f23e98001f81" label="lyrics-like">nimus vocábitur in regno caelórum:</l><l xml:id="m-25aa7fbf-e678-40bd-b6fb-e0bbe51bb5ab" facs="#m-5af4fda5-562d-4f70-b0f7-0c196f8aa49b" label="lyrics-like">qui autem fécerit, et docúerit, hic</l><l xml:id="m-51673303-62e2-46ef-8b97-7bde4a225fb1" facs="#m-b7d8285b-8b3e-43ab-8799-62d413e3cc23" label="lyrics-like">ceat ómnibus, qui in domo sunt. Sic</l><l xml:id="m-828a32ad-600a-41a8-bbdc-108e136c9016" facs="#m-9ac58ccd-259a-4b86-b5fd-5de0d82f5762" label="lyrics-like">magnus vocábitur in regno caeló¬</l><l xml:id="m-afd34bcb-1d50-4c30-8ccb-1f80d211ac4c" facs="#m-22dfcc43-bd76-4533-ac49-b840576e10ca" label="lyrics-like">lúceat lux vestra coram hominibus,</l><l xml:id="m-50dedfb4-8361-4d0a-b886-7828c6cbb450" facs="#m-9c73d513-1e65-4b6a-9558-b134d550d327" label="lyrics-like">ut videant ópera vestra bona, et</l><l xml:id="m-bc954790-485f-40e4-b7e4-fd68a7c7d3a0" facs="#m-11e735df-f1f0-4fba-b9a4-7b72d67e0f08" label="ambiguous">rum.</l><l xml:id="m-fad1729f-af99-4de7-9da8-ad3b4242ea7b" facs="#m-8592d6c3-b164-4c2d-89d1-577c243982c1" label="lyrics-like">gloríficent Patrem vestrum, qui in</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>